ive Investment Division", "coverage": "AI infrastructure value chain / data centers / infrastructure debt / ABF / direct lending    |    Full report dated 5 Oct 2026", "toc": [], "summary": "Upstream supplies the five components carrying the bulk of AI server BOM value: GPU, HBM, advanced packaging (CoWoS), PCB/substrate, optical modules. Midstream runs two production lines — components into complete racks, ", "source_file": "source.docx"}, {"id": "infrastructure-2026Q3-full-2bd31bc5", "title": "2026Q3 AI 基础设施投资机会全景", "sector": "infrastructure", "year": 2026, "quarter": 3, "period": "3Q2026", "period_key": 20263, "nature": "full", "language": "cn", "keywords": ["AI 基础设施产业链", "数据中心", "infrastructure debt", "ABF", "direct lending"], "source_name": "Junson_AI_Infrastructure_Report_2026Q3_CN_v3.docx", "source_ext": ".docx", "uploaded_at": "2026-11-03T08:53:35.888Z", "stats": {"blocks": 75, "images": 3, "tables": 11, "chars": 15413}, "exhibit_count": 14, "masthead": "JUNSON Capital Research", "coverage": "AI 基础设施产业链 / 数据中心 / infrastructure debt / ABF / direct lending", "publish_date": "2026 年 10 月 5 日", "toc": [{"level": 1, "text": "产业链全景"}, {"level": 2, "text": "三层结构：从芯片到终端用户"}, {"level": 2, "text": "AI 价值链 vs 数据中心产业链"}, {"level": 1, "text": "供给瓶颈"}, {"level": 2, "text": "瓶颈集中在上中游；下游延期是传导性的"}, {"level": 2, "text": "“不敢”与“不能”：两大最深短缺为何是结构性的"}, {"level": 1, "text": "股还是债？机会定位图"}, {"level": 2, "text": "两个问题决定工具"}, {"level": 2, "text": "横轴怎么读：现金流被合同锁定的程度"}, {"level": 2, "text": "纵轴怎么读：违约时能拿走什么"}, {"level": 2, "text": "收益率锚点"}, {"level": 1, "text": "资本市场深度"}, {"level": 2, "text": "逐行解读"}, {"level": 1, "text": "上游：分板块明细"}, {"level": 2, "text": "名词卡：fab、fabless、foundry 与 IDM"}, {"level": 2, "text": "上游四个结论"}, {"level": 1, "text": "中游：分板块明细"}, {"level": 2, "text": "中游四个结论"}, {"level": 1, "text": "下游：分板块明细"}, {"level": 2, "text": "下游四个结论"}, {"level": 1, "text": "下行风险"}, {"level": 2, "text": "贯穿全链的五大风险"}, {"level": 2, "text": "分板块下行风险"}, {"level": 1, "text": "基金评估"}, {"level": 2, "text": "可投基金宇宙：三种类型"}, {"level": 2, "text": "五个问题，锚定本报告"}, {"level": 2, "text": "分类型尽调重点"}], "summary": "我们把数据中心产业链分为三层。上游供应半导体与核心零部件：GPU 裸片与 HBM 存储通过 TSMC 的 CoWoS 工艺封装成一颗器件；封装好的芯片再焊到载板 / PCB（芯片的“座位”）上；光模块完全不在封装之内，而是插在交换机上连接机柜。上游还包括 CPU、网络与电源半导体，以及晶圆厂背后的设备与材料层；本文聚焦上述五个零部件，因为它们占 AI 服务器 BOM 价值的大头，也是当前供给瓶颈与定价权所在。中游把零部件变成整机、把楼变", "updated_at": "2026-11-03T08:55:31+00:00", "source_file": "source.docx"}, {"id": "infrastructure-2026Q3-full-3c69f100", "title": "2026Q3 AI Infrastructure Opportunities Mapping", "sector": "infrastructure", "year": 2026, "quarter": 3, "period": "3Q2026", "period_key": 20263, "nature": "full", "language": "en", "keywords": ["AI infrastructure value chain", "data centers", "infrastructure debt", "ABF", "direct lending"], "source_name": "Junson_AI_Infrastructure_Report_2026Q3_EN_v3.docx", "source_ext": ".docx", "uploaded_at": "2026-11-03T08:52:53.503Z", "stats": {"blocks": 75, "images": 3, "tables": 11, "chars": 40659}, "exhibit_count": 14, "masthead": "JUNSON Capital Research", "coverage": "AI infrastructure value chain / data centers / infrastructure debt / ABF / direct lending", "publish_date": "5 Oct, 2026", "toc": [{"level": 1, "text": "Value Chain"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Three layers: from chips to the end-user"}, {"level": 2, "text": "The AI value chain vs the data center value chain"}, {"level": 1, "text": "Supply Bottlenecks"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Constraints sit upstream and midstream; downstream delays are transmitted"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Won't vs can't: why the two deepest shortages are structural"}, {"level": 1, "text": "Equity or Credit? The Positioning Map"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Two questions decide the instrument"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Yield anchors"}, {"level": 1, "text": "Capital Market Depth"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Row-by-row read"}, {"level": 1, "text": "Upstream: Sub-sector Detail"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Primer: fab, fabless, foundry and IDM"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Four upstream conclusions"}, {"level": 1, "text